{"repositoryId":1411673005,"availability":"available","full":"toclocoinc/lattice-grid-demo-htmx-gantt","name":"lattice-grid-demo-htmx-gantt","description":"An htmx Gantt chart over a server-rendered task table, built with Lattice Grid: hx-get swaps, out-of-band task updates, hx-post on drag, zoom kept on Back.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T10:34:34Z","updated":"2026-10-12T19:07:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://toclocoinc.github.io/lattice-grid-demo-htmx-gantt/","topics":["data-grid","gantt-chart","htmx","javascript","lattice-grid"],"demo":"https://toclocoinc.github.io/lattice-grid-demo-htmx-gantt/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.257Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.257Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.257Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.257Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The server renders a plain of tasks inside a data-lattice-gantt element. Lattice Grid turns it into a split view, a task grid on the left and a timeline on the right, with no mount code on the page: only markup, htmx and the Lattice htmx module.","The plan is a two-year programme (and a second, data-centre migration plan) with phases, milestones, finish-to-start links, the critical path and progress. The page shows five things:"],"features":["Built on load. The server-rendered task table becomes the Gantt. With JavaScript off it is still a readable table.","Swap. Picking the other project runs an hx-get; the old Gantt is torn down and a new one is built from the new table.","Out of band. \"Server slips one task\" returns one with hx-swap-oob, and only that task's bar moves.","Edit. Dragging a bar raises one bubbling lattice:gantt-commit event carrying every task the move rescheduled; hx-trigger=\"lattice:gantt-commit\" posts the whole edit with a single hx-post, and the server's reply appears…","Back. The zoom, scroll and collapsed rows are saved with htmx's history snapshot and come back when you press Back."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/toclocoinc/lattice-grid-demo-htmx-gantt/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"10afe4883408e9643259ac094ab41eef98c0eaab2cede62f56cfc3aac1ec46ae","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.415Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.415Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The server renders a plain of tasks inside a data-lattice-gantt element. Lattice Grid turns it into a split view, a task grid on the left and a timeline on the right, with no mount code on the page: only markup, htmx and the Lattice htmx module.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/toclocoinc/lattice-grid-demo-htmx-gantt/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"10afe4883408e9643259ac094ab41eef98c0eaab2cede62f56cfc3aac1ec46ae","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/toclocoinc/lattice-grid-demo-htmx-gantt/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.415Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T19:07:10Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/toclocoinc/lattice-grid-demo-htmx-gantt/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:21.415Z","hash":"10afe4883408e9643259ac094ab41eef98c0eaab2cede62f56cfc3aac1ec46ae","originalBytes":2900,"storedBytes":2900,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["gantt","server","task","htmx","lattice","one","plan","grid","html","htmx-demo","src","demo","main.js","npm","page","run","stand-in","back.","bar","built","change","chrome","gantt-commit","handlers","index.html","key","licence","mock-server.js","move","new","only","out","post","renders","reply","return","route","server-rendered","server.js","table","table.","after","already","answers","anything","appears","back","backend","backend.","band","band.","becomes","browser","bubbling","carrying","chart","chart.","check","code","code.","collapsed","come","commercially","critical","data","data-centre",